1055
00:53:14.041 --> 00:53:15.750
- Raef?
- Yeah.

1056
00:53:15.833 --> 00:53:17.666
Where is he?
Why isn't he saying hi?

1057
00:53:17.750 --> 00:53:19.166
- Raef!
- Raef!

1058
00:53:19.250 --> 00:53:20.642
