- Raef!

1059
00:53:20.666 --> 00:53:22.958
It's gotten really serious,

1060
00:53:23.041 --> 00:53:24.458
- like, so quickly.
- Has it?

1061
00:53:24.541 --> 00:53:25.833
Yeah.

1062
00:53:25.916 --> 00:53:27.333
It's so good.

1063
00:53:27.416 --> 00:53:30.083
Well, my boyfriend's name is Camino.

1064
00:53:30.166 --> 00:53:32.041
I'm, like, halfway through.

1065
00:53:32.125 --> 00:53:33.375
Where are you guys?

1066
00:53:33.458 --> 00:53:36.666
We're in a cute little... B and B.

1067
00:53:36.750 --> 00:53:38.458
Tell us everything.

1068
00:53:38.541 --> 00:53:39.666
Yeah.

1069
00:53:39.750 --> 00:53:41.416
We're just wandering.

1070
00:53:42.291 --> 00:53:45.541
Like, we live by
his great-grandfather's journal.

1071
00:53:46.625 --> 00:53:47.958
We don't even make a plan.

1072
00:53:48.041 --> 00:53:49.541
We just go.

1073
00:53:49.625 --> 00:53:52.000
