1079
00:54:21.375 --> 00:54:23.958
No. He... he doesn't have plans.

1080
00:54:24.041 --> 00:54:26.916
But the way that we talk...

1081
00:54:28.291 --> 00:54:31.000
it makes me feel like he would.

1082
00:54:31.083 --> 00:54:34.583
Do you want him
to come back with you?

1083
00:54:34.666 --> 00:54:36.000
I would love him to.

1084
00:54:36.583 --> 00:54:38.791
I would love for him to be
in New York with me.

1085
00:54:41.500 --> 00:54:43.625
It's not just a tryst.

1086
00:54:43.708 --> 00:54:45.458
