- You know?

1087
00:54:48.416 --> 00:54:50.500
I think I'm in love.

1088
00:54:50.583 --> 00:54:52.916
Wait, she said the "L" word.

1089
00:54:54.458 --> 00:54:55.916
Oh, I'm going to throw up.

1090
00:55:01.166 --> 00:55:03.583
Oh, my gosh,
you got to figure this out then.

1091
00:55:03.666 --> 00:55:06.375
I miss it already. I miss him already.

1092
00:55:07.666 --> 00:55:11.458
I don't want to just never see each other.

1093
00:55:13.541 --> 00:55:15.500
I need to bring...
I'm going to bring it up.

1094
00:55:15.583 --> 00:55:16.791
I'm going to bring it up.

1095
00:55:41.208 --> 00:55:42.666
English. English, please.

1096
00:55:42.750 --> 00:55:44.226
This is clinic a Pamplona,

1097
00:55:44.250 --> 00:55:45.958
