- ♪ I want you to know ♪
- ♪ I want you to know ♪

1601
01:28:17.750 --> 01:28:20.208
- ♪ Do you hear me? ♪
- ♪ Hear me? ♪

1602
01:28:20.291 --> 01:28:24.750
- ♪ I just want you to be free ♪
- ♪ Free ♪

1603
